{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/HyperMap Embedding.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/HyperMap Embedding.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"hyper map embedding hyper map embedding","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/HyperMap Embedding.md","fileName":"HyperMap Embedding.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"HyperMap Embedding","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-06 22:09\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Hyperbolic Network Analytics]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Hyperbolic Network Analytics","Poincare Disk Model","bigdataincomplexandsocialnetworks.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/HyperMap Embedding.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/HyperMap Embedding.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"hyper map embedding hyper map embedding","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/HyperMap Embedding.md","fileName":"HyperMap Embedding.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"HyperMap Embedding","heading":"HyperMap Embedding","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"HyperMap embeds a scale-free network in the [[Poincare Disk Model]] by approximately maximizing the likelihood of its observed links. It orders nodes by degree, associates that order with arrival time, assigns radial coordinates, and estimates angular coordinates from local likelihoods.\n\nUnlike distance-preserving embedding, HyperMap tries to reconstruct a plausible hyperbolic growth process. The inferred coordinates can also predict missing links because nearby non-neighbors receive a higher connection probability.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Hyperbolic Network Analytics","Poincare Disk Model","bigdataincomplexandsocialnetworks.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/HyperMap Embedding.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/HyperMap Embedding.md","sourceType":"markdown","se